- B | borrow what it takes, and back yourself to pay it back | v: power, achievement | aim: pay | cost: money .6, time .1, family .2 | foot: means money-.08 | chance: 60
- R | throw everything at it now, savings and all | v: stimulation, self-direction | aim: pay | cost: money .7, time .3, family .3 | foot: mark took a wild risk | chance: 55
